{
    "title": "Find Fun Difference: Spot it!",
    "description": "<b>Find Fun Difference: Spot it! </b> is an intriguing and relaxing free game! It's a visual puzzle that trains your brain and helps you destress and calm. Engage your inner detective as seeking out subtle distinctions between two stunning pictures. Immerse yourself in the art of observation, allowing your mind to unwind.\r\n\r\nExplore a vast collection of thousands of photos and indulge in the joy of finding differences. Sharpen your focus and get ready to compare and contrast as you embark on an exciting journey of visual discovery. Dive into the world of Spot it, embrace the joy of observation, and make the most of your leisure time with this delightful and relaxing free puzzle game. Download now and embark on an enchanting adventure of discovery!\r\n\r\n<b>HOW TO PLAY: </b>\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Compare two pictures and spot differences between them.\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Click to circle and highlight your findings.\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Pinch to zoom in the image for a closer look.\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Need a clue? Click the hint button when you are stuck.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURES: </b>\r\n\u23f0 No time limit! Enjoy the game at your own pace.\r\n\ud83e\udd70 User-friendly game control that effortlessly draws you in.\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0e Tons of pictures covering various themes: Animals, Landscapes, Foods, and more.\r\n\u2b06\ufe0f Enjoy a moderate difficulty level suitable for all ages.\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Train your memory and concentration.\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Crafted puzzles keep you from getting bored.\r\n\r\n<b>CONTACT US: </b>\r\nWe keep updating this game! Please contact us if you have any questions or suggestions.\r\nEmail: hipposbro@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Find Fun Difference: Spot it! </b> is an intriguing and relaxing free game! It&#39;s a visual puzzle that trains your brain and helps you destress and calm. Engage your inner detective as seeking out subtle distinctions between two stunning pictures. Immerse yourself in the art of observation, allowing your mind to unwind.<br><br>Explore a vast collection of thousands of photos and indulge in the joy of finding differences. Sharpen your focus and get ready to compare and contrast as you embark on an exciting journey of visual discovery. Dive into the world of Spot it, embrace the joy of observation, and make the most of your leisure time with this delightful and relaxing free puzzle game. Download now and embark on an enchanting adventure of discovery!<br><br><b>HOW TO PLAY: </b><br>\ud83d\udc4d Compare two pictures and spot differences between them.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Click to circle and highlight your findings.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Pinch to zoom in the image for a closer look.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Need a clue? Click the hint button when you are stuck.<br><br><b>FEATURES: </b><br>\u23f0 No time limit! Enjoy the game at your own pace.<br>\ud83e\udd70 User-friendly game control that effortlessly draws you in.<br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0e Tons of pictures covering various themes: Animals, Landscapes, Foods, and more.<br>\u2b06\ufe0f Enjoy a moderate difficulty level suitable for all ages.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Train your memory and concentration.<br>\ud83e\udde9 Crafted puzzles keep you from getting bored.<br><br><b>CONTACT US: </b><br>We keep updating this game! Please contact us if you have any questions or suggestions.<br>Email: hipposbro@gmail.com",
